  "definition": "Alternative Methods of Signatures for Authorized Agents",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-06-21",
  "historyNote": "#8389, eff 7-8-05, renumbered by #9930 (from Rev 2904.06); ss by #10388, eff 7-25-13; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
